    <body class="c29 c75">
        <span class="c9" style="text-align:center;"><apex:outputPanel style="text-align:center; color:grey; opacity: 0.5;;">
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;RATING AGREEMENT FOR PTC 
        </apex:outputPanel>
        </span>
        <p class="c1 c4" id="h.gjdgxs"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class=""><span class="c19 c5 c3">RATING AGREEMENT </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c19 c5 c3">{!Opportunity.MPRA_SoW_Reference_Number__c} </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c2 c5">Date: &nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}" rendered="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c!=null}"><apex:param value="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c}" /></apex:outputText> 
            <apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}" rendered="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c==null}"><apex:param value="{!Today()}"/></apex:outputText></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c5 c3">{!oppContact.Salutation}&nbsp;{!oppContact.FirstName}&nbsp;{!oppContact.LastName}</span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3">{!Opportunity.Account.Name}</span> </span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3">{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Street__c}</span></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3">{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_City__c} &nbsp; {!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Zip_Postal_Code__c}</span></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3">{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.BillingState__c}</span></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c3 c5"><span class="c5 c3">Dear </span>{!oppContact.Salutation} {!oppContact.LastName},</span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c3"> Please refer your request to ICRA Limited (ICRA) seeking a Rating for Pass Through Certificates (“PTC”) backed by a pool of <span class="c5">{!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode} {!Opportunity.Cash_Flow_Pool__c}</span> crore (equivalent to total future pool receivables as on pool commencement date, with total pool principal being <span class="c5">{!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!Opportunity.VoD_in_crore__c}" /></apex:outputText></span> crore) (hereinafter referred to as the “Security”) under the securitisation programme originated by <span class="c5">{!Opportunity.Account.Name}</span> (hereinafter referred to as “your Company” or “you” or “your”), to be issued through a Special Purpose Vehicle {!Opportunity.Scheme_Trust_Name__c} under Private Placement (which is not proposed to be listed).</span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c3"> ICRA is pleased to take up your mandate and looks forward to carrying out the assignment once it has received your acceptance of the terms of this Agreement as enumerated below. “ICRA”, “we”, “our” and “us” refer to ICRA Limited and all directors, officers and employees of ICRA Limited.</span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1"><span class="c19 c5 c3">TERMS OF RATING AGREEMENT</span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Definitions</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_12-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">&ldquo;</span><span class="c19 c5 c3">Agreement</span><span class="c2">&rdquo; refers to these written terms and conditions of this agreement, rating requisition form, and all schedules and annexures, each as may be amended, supplemented or modified from time to time or at any time as per directive(s) issued by Securities Exchange Board of India (&ldquo;</span><span class="c19 c5 c3">SEBI</span><span class="c2">&rdquo;)</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_12-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">&ldquo;Credit Rating&rdquo; </span><span class="c2"> or </span><span class="c19 c5 c3">&ldquo;Rating&rdquo; </span><span class="c2">refers to an opinion regarding the securities under the Transaction (defined below), expressed in the form of standard symbols or in any other standardized manner, assigned by ICRA and used by the issuer of such securities, to comply with a requirement specified by SEBI (Credit Rating Agencies) Regulations, 1999 and corresponding guidelines and circulars as may be issued by SEBI from time to time (</span> <span class="c19 c5 c3">&ldquo;Regulations&rdquo; </span><span class="c2"> ). ICRA’s credit ratings do not address any other risk, including liquidity risk, market value risk, or price volatility. Any rating must be construed solely as a statement of opinion and not a statement of fact. A Credit Rating is not an offer, invitation, inducement or recommendation to purchase, sell or hold any securities or otherwise act in relation to any issue, the relevant issuer (each an </span> <span class="c19 c5 c3">&ldquo;Issuer&rdquo; </span> <span class="c2"> ) or the relevant transaction (each, a </span> <span class="c19 c5 c3">&ldquo;Transaction&rdquo; </span> <span class="c2">) to which this Agreement relates or otherwise in connection with any associated transaction, entity, or matter. References in this Agreement to &ldquo;rating&ldquo; or &ldquo;credit rating&ldquo; also encompass any revalidation of the Rating and the terms of this Agreement will apply to any such revalidation of the Rating.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_12-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">&ldquo;</span><span class="c19 c5 c3">Rating Fee</span><span class="c2">&rdquo; refers to the non-refundable initial fee payable in advance by your Company to ICRA in consideration for the Rating to be assigned by ICRA to the Security and shall be exclusive of the applicable tax payable thereon.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_12-0" start="4">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">&ldquo;Surveillance Fee&rdquo; </span><span class="c2"> refers to the fee for the continuous monitoring of the Rating by ICRA from the date of assignment of initial Rating during the term of the Rating.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_12-0" start="5">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">&ldquo;</span><span class="c19 c5 c3">Unpublished Price Sensitive Information (</span><span class="c2">&ldquo;</span><span class="c19 c5 c3">UPSI</span><span class="c2">&rdquo;)&rdquo;</span><span class="c2"> means any information, relating to your Company or your securities, directly or indirectly, that is not generally available and which upon becoming generally available, is likely to materially affect the price of the securities and shall, ordinarily include but not restricted to, information relating to the financial results, dividends, change in capital structure, mergers, de-mergers, acquisitions, de-listings, disposals and expansion of business and such other transactions, and changes in key managerial personnel and/or any other information which is accompanied by a written notice specifying that such information is an UPSI.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Scope of Work and Rating Fees</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">ICRA shall, after due consideration, assign a Rating (accompanied, if necessary, by an outlook and/or other indicators) to the said Security of your Company.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="2"></ol>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">Upon acceptance of the Rating or notification of use of the Rating by your Company to ICRA in the manner set out in clause D (I) below and subject to clause F of this Agreement, ICRA shall keep the Rating under surveillance during the lifetime of the Security. The Company shall co-operate with ICRA to enable the later to carry out periodic review of the rating during the tenure of the Rating.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0">
                <span class="c3">The Rating fee payable by your Company to ICRA is {!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.IRF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/- plus applicable GST and/or any other applicable taxes. The Surveillance Fee from the second year onwards will be {!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp; <apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.ASF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/-, plus applicable GST and/or any other applicable taxes, and shall be payable each year during the term of the Rating. It is hereby clarified that notwithstanding your non-acceptance of the Rating or failure to notify ICRA of your acceptance/non-acceptance of the Rating, any use of the Rating by your Company, in any manner whatsoever, shall obligate your Company to pay the Surveillance Fee after ICRA becomes aware of the use of the Rating. 
                    <span class="c3">
                        <apex:outputText rendered="{!Opportunity.OPE__c == 'Capped'}">
                            ICRA shall charge out-of-pocket expenses (“OPE”) on account of travel, hotel accommodation, and other expenses incurred at actuals subject to a cap of Rs. 
                            <apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##}">
                                <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Amt_of_CAP_fee__c}" />
                            </apex:outputText>.
                            Any such fees will be payable upon receipt of an invoice from ICRA.
                        </apex:outputText>
                        
                        <apex:outputText rendered="{!Opportunity.OPE__c == 'Absorbed'}">
                            ICRA shall absorb out-of-pocket expenses (“OPE”) on account of travel, hotel accommodation, and other expenses incurred at actuals.
                        </apex:outputText>
                        
                        <apex:outputText rendered="{!Opportunity.OPE__c == 'Reimbursed'}">
                            ICRA shall charge out-of-pocket expenses (“OPE”) on account of travel, hotel accommodation, and other expenses incurred at actuals.
                            Any such fees will be payable upon receipt of an invoice from ICRA.
                        </apex:outputText>
                    </span>
                    Rating Fee/Surveillance Fee shall be paid by your Company by way of cheque or demand draft or transfer through electronic medium in favour of &ldquo;ICRA Limited&rdquo;. All Fees as mentioned herein shall not be refundable under any circumstances and payable within&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Payment_Terms__c}" /> </apex:outputText> days from the date of invoice, failing which, ICRA reserves the right to recover 
                        interest on the delayed payment, at the rate of&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Delayed_Payment_Interest_Rate__c}" /> </apex:outputText> % p.a., from your company. ICRA reserves the right to revise the Surveillance Fee payable by you under this SOW subject to maximum of&nbsp;
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c != 'Other' }">
                           {! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c}
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c == 'Other' }">
                           <apex:outputText value="{0,number,###0.00}">
                              <apex:param value="{! Opportunity.Other__c }"/>
                          </apex:outputText>%
                        </apex:outputPanel> of the Security.
                </span>
            </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="4">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Invoicing and contact details: Your Company shall provide the following details along with copy of PAN and TAN with ICRA for the purpose of invoicing:  </span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_69-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c19 c50 c39">Billing Contact Name: {!oppContactName.Salutation}&nbsp;{!oppContactName.FirstName}&nbsp;{!oppContactName.LastName}</span></li>
            <li class="c10 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c19 c50 c39">Designation:{!oppContactName.Designation__c}</span></li>
            <li class="c10 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c19 c50 c39">Mailing Address: {!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Street__c}&nbsp;{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_City__c}&nbsp;{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Zip_Postal_Code__c}&nbsp;{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.BillingState__c}</span></li>
            <li class="c1 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c19 c50 c39">Telephone: {!oppContactName.MobilePhone}</span></li>
            <li class="c10 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c19 c39 c50">E-mail Address: {!oppContactName.Email}</span></li>
            <li class="c10 c27 c32 li-bullet-2"><span class="c19 c50 c39">Permanent Account No: {!Opportunity.Account.PAN_Number__c} (Please share the copy of PAN)</span></li>
