            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c35 c3">Disclaimer of warranties</span><span class="c2">: All information, including the Ratings and other communications, provided by ICRA relating to you, this Agreement (inclusive of any SOW entered into pursuant hereto), any issue, Bank Facility, Scheme, Security or Transaction, is provided &quot;as is&quot; and without representation or warranty of any kind; in particular, neither ICRA nor its agents make any representation or warranty, express or implied, as to the accuracy, timeliness, completeness, merchantability or fitness for any particular purpose of any such information or communication.</span></li>
