        <p class="c1 c4 c21"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c49 li-bullet-6"><span class="c2">In addition to the instances specified in clause D (II) of the Agreement which might require revalidation of the Rating, if the Security is not issued by you within a period of 3 (three) months from the date of the letter communicating the Rating, the same would need to be revalidated before expiry of the 3 (three) months. </span></li>
        </ol>        
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="9">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Information Required from your Company</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Your Company agrees to provide (or cause to be provided to ICRA) all information and clarifications relevant for the purposes of assigning and, on an ongoing basis, for the purposes of monitoring, the Rating(s) requested under this Agreement and to provide the information sought by ICRA immediately, but (subject to sub-clause III below) not later than 7 (seven) days from the date of seeking such information by ICRA. </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Your Company shall disclose to ICRA in writing all details relating to any default and/or delay in meeting debt obligations in the past. Additionally, your Company shall immediately disclose to ICRA in writing, all pertinent details relating to any default or delay which may occur in future in meeting debt obligations. You hereby consent that ICRA shall obtain the details related to existing and/or future borrowing of any nature, its repayment and delay or default, if any, of any nature, in servicing of the borrowing, either from the lender or any other statutory/non-statutory organization maintaining any such information to enable ICRA to have timely information on the same and to consider the impact of such information on the rating assigned by ICRA.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c32 c15 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">Your Company shall disclose the history and status (non-cooperation, non-payment of fees etc.) of previous rating relation with any earlier credit rating agency(s) to ICRA along with the reasons for non-cooperation etc., if applicable as per the Regulations. </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0" start="4">
            <li class="c1 c32 c15 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">In cases of delay/ default in servicing debt obligations, the information shall be provided immediately to ICRA. Failure to provide the same immediately shall be considered as suppression of material information and may result in violation of the provisions of section 12A of the Securities and Exchange Board of India Act, 1992 and SEBI (Prohibition of Fraudulent and Unfair Trade Practices relating to Securities Market) Regulations, 2003.</span></li>
