        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3">II.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;to immediately inform ICRA of any other developments or material events the occurrence of which would require ICRA, as a registered credit rating agency, to conduct a review of the Rating under the Regulations; </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15 c24"><span class="c12"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c92 li-bullet-7"><span class="c2">to inform ICRA immediately: (i) about any change in the terms and conditions or size of the Security before the issue of such Security; (ii) as and when the borrowing limit, as prescribed by the regulatory authority (ies), is exceeded for the Security ; (iii) about any default or delay in payment of interest and/or principal against any debt instruments or borrowings of your Company; (iv) of any other developments that may have a direct or indirect impact on the debt servicing capability of your Company. Such developments will include, inter alia, significant expansion plans, change in business plans and/or any proposal for re-schedulement or postponement of the repayment programmes of the dues/debts of your Company; and (v) of any use of the Rating, following your non-acceptance of the Rating or failure to notify your acceptance/non-acceptance of the Rating to ICRA;</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0" start="4">
            <li class="c1 c59 li-bullet-8"><span class="c2">to disclose in the offer document in case of public issue, the rating assigned to any of your Company’s listed securities by any credit rating agency during the last 3 (three) years and also, any rating given in respect of the securities by any other credit rating agency, which has not been accepted by your Company;</span></li>
