        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0" start="5">
            <li class="c1 c59 li-bullet-8"><span class="c2">to provide ICRA a &ldquo;No Default Statement&rdquo; as provided in Annexure A on a monthly basis wherein the Company shall explicitly confirm that it has not delayed on any payment of interest/principal in the previous month. Such statement shall be provided to ICRA on the first working day of the next month.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="11">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Warranty</span></li>
